# Logs
logs
*.log

# Local documentation artifacts. Only docs/superpowers/ (design + recovery
# runbooks) and hand-written docs/*.mjs tooling are tracked; the 2026-07
# docs/issue-triage/ workbench was discarded once the g0v/moedict-webkit
# backlog it triaged was closed, so its negations are gone too.
docs/*
!docs/
!docs/*.mjs
!docs/superpowers/
!docs/superpowers/**
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
.worktrees/
dist
dist-ssr
build/stardict/
build/kindle/
*.local

